Hi all:

Gentoo/Alpha announces the end of 2.4 alpha support in our distribution. 

All other architecture teams have already dropped the 2.4 support and 
while this is not something we would like to do, we don't have the 
required manpower to keep it up to date.

2.4 profile has been removed and the last stable mark in
vanilla-sources-2.4 will follow the same way (although we will keep the
~alpha).

If there is someone still using 2.4 with Gentoo, please let us know and
we will see what can we do to move to 2.6.

Thanks everybody.

-- 
Jose Luis Rivero <yoswink@gentoo.org>
Gentoo/Doc Gentoo/Alpha

-- 
gentoo-alpha@lists.gentoo.org mailing list


